## Architecture (Hexagonal Core)

- `src/{{package_name}}/domain/` — Pure, frozen Pydantic v2 contracts (`Decimal` precision, explicit UTC `datetime` arguments, `extra="forbid"`). No OS, filesystem, network, or clock side effects.
- `src/{{package_name}}/ports/` — Typed `Protocol` interfaces (`Clock`, `RecordRepository`).
- `src/{{package_name}}/adapters/` — Concrete implementations (`SystemClock`, `InMemoryRecordRepository`).
- `src/{{package_name}}/workflows/` — Application workflows wired solely through ports.
- `src/{{package_name}}/config/` — `pydantic-settings` configuration with `load_dotenv(override=False)` so process and container environment variables always take precedence over `.env`.
- `tests/invariants/` — AST boundary tests verifying domain isolation.

